  "description": "<h3><strong>WipeXpert &mdash; Affiliate Program Overview</strong></h3>\r\n<p><em>(For Partners &amp; Promoters)</em></p>\r\n<h4><strong>1. Brand Introduction</strong></h4>\r\n<p><strong>WipeXpert</strong>&nbsp;is a premium hygiene solutions brand specializing in&nbsp;<strong>high-performance, eco-conscious wipes</strong>&nbsp;for diverse needs. We combine innovation with sustainability to deliver convenient, planet-friendly cleaning alternatives for modern lifestyles.</p>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h4><strong>2. Product Description</strong></h4>\r\n<p><strong>a) Pet Wipes</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Gentle, pH-balanced wipes for paws, fur &amp; odor control</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Vet-recommended, alcohol-free formula</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>b) Lens Wipes</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Streak-free cleaning for glasses, screens &amp; camera lenses</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Anti-static &amp; anti-fog technology</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>c) Flushable Wipes</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>100% biodegradable, septic-safe &amp; plant-based fibers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Ideal for travel &amp; on-the-go hygiene</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>d) Face Towels</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Ultra-soft, reusable facial cleansing towels</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Makeup removal + exfoliation in one</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h4><strong>3. USP (Unique Selling Points)</strong></h4>\r\n<p>✅&nbsp;<strong>Eco-Advantage</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>All wipes use&nbsp;<strong>biodegradable materials</strong>&nbsp;(excluding deodorant)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Plastic-free packaging for 3/4 product lines</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>✅&nbsp;<strong>Multi-Scenario Use</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Covers pets, electronics, personal care &amp; home hygiene</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>✅&nbsp;<strong>Premium Formulations</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>No harsh chemicals (paraben/SLS-free)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Dermatologist-tested (Face Towels &amp; Pet Wipes)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>✅&nbsp;<strong>Strong Market Fit</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>Rising demand in&nbsp;<strong>pet care</strong>&nbsp;(+25% YOY growth) &amp;&nbsp;<strong>sustainable hygiene</strong>&nbsp;niches</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h4><strong>4. Payment Terms</strong></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Commission Rate</strong>: 10% per sale (all products)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Cookie Duration</strong>: 30-day tracking</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Payout Schedule</strong>: Bi-monthly (1st &amp; 15th) via PayPal</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Bonus</strong>: +3% commission for sales over 100 units/month</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h4><strong>5. Other Key Information</strong></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Shipping</strong>: Free Shipping on orders &gt;$50 (Contiguous U.S. only)<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.wipexpert.com/policies/shipping-policy\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.wipexpert.com/policies/shipping-policy</a></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Content Kits Provided</strong>: High-res product images, demo videos, FAQ guides</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr>\r\n<h3><strong>Why Promote WipeXpert?</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>High Conversion Potential</strong>: Recurring purchase products with loyal customer base</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Low Returns</strong>: &lt;2% return rate due to quality focus</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Trend-Aligned</strong>: Taps into&nbsp;<em>sustainability</em>,&nbsp;<em>pet humanization</em>, and&nbsp;<em>home hygiene</em>&nbsp;trends</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>",
